{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eqjHQroUI21795419584.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山高級分區營業經理張文山表示，分行新近促成西半山63 POKFULAM 租賃成交，單位為2座中層D室，實用面積270平方呎，採1房間隔，向南，望香港大學校園景致。單位最新以20,800元租出，折合實用呎租77元。</p><p><br/>張文山表示，新租客為內地專科研究生，心儀上址鄰近校園，見間隔合適即決定承租單位。據了解，業主於2018年以871.1萬元購入單位，持貨8年，是次出租可享約2.9厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.493381+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T19:07:27.939507+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:18.102003+00:00","content_hash":"00c6f180ba89d22dc0e54da6e26aebcd5de1a97a96512c547affc54a3a063c46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.493381+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}